## Iridium 1.0.19 - Service Management Improvements

### Added
- Restart buttons for all services on Dashboard (Telegram Bot, IP Limit, NormalSub)
- API endpoints for restarting Telegram Bot, IP Limit, and NormalSub services

### Changed
- Subscription Service: Domain/Port fields now hidden when service is running
- Shows info message instead of config inputs when NormalSub is active

### Fixed
- Unified restart button handling across all services
